					<meta name="Description" content="Farmer's Daily - What you grow is who you become. Each of the 25 crops hides an ability that grows with every harvest, and what to plant is up to you. Farm for 30 minutes while auto-attacking tools hold off the swarms, and survive three bosses. All the art is drawn by code, hence the odd look. We know.">
			
